1. First emission → 201
2. Second emission → 200
3. Same codigo/certificado
4. no new row in DB (though that's internal; but spec says "sem nova emissão" — the epitro pees check the same code/certificado; checking the DB row count via HTTP wouldn't be possible... Actually certidão test uses DB directly but the guidance says the HTTP test should verify status codes and the same code/certificate. For "no new row", we could compare via GET /certificados listing - but that's R9 continuation in fatia 2. Hmm. Actually the user request says "sem nova linha no banco" is part of the scenario to validate via HTTP behavior. But per the skill's rule: "não importe serviço nem repositório no teste". The existing certificado.test.ts uses HTTP only.

